    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Pull station with a recessed T-handle, modelled key lock, raised FIRE / ALARM lettering and a keyed mounting slot on the rear plate. The lettering is real geometry, clear in the clay and wireframe views. Rear and bottom views confirm a closed backbox. Just 2.7k tris.",
    "limitations": [
      "Lower badge reads HOTRESCUE, an invented brand rather than a real manufacturer.",
      "Pull handle is modelled in the armed position with no rig."
    ],
